Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles added by Hanson Hu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Episode 18 - Making a Difference
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Carter Boswell!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Carter Boswell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running for the school board.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The election's next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with wanting to be on the school board?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But he wants to cut the school budget!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it needs cutting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting the budget is fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but he wants to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,by cutting all the cultural programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No music, no dance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,no concert, no stage presentations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He says it's to save the taxpayers' money,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and I think he believes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that the taxpayers will vote for him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,if he spends less on the cultural programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of people want their taxes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,used for new books
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and a new paint job in the schoolrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe some of us would like to pay a little bit more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep the cultural programs for our kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not sure, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear it from my patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of people are tired of higher taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but if Boswell wins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be an important decision-maker
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,on the school board,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and he doesn't know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,about our children's education.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's running against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody. That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it sounds to me like Carter Boswell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is going to win this seat on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not if I can stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are you going to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll run against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've got my vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious, Philip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I run?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't you run for what, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother is thinking of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,running for the school board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's terrific, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Against Carter Boswell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if I run for office,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the voters will have a clear choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I stand for everything Boswell doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think a lot of people will vote for you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,against Boswell, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll vote for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help me if I do run?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The trouble is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes a little bit of money to run a campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you can make a difference, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And in a short campaign
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't need as much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know something, Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not give the people of Riverdale a clear choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.28,0:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Maxwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Charles Maxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Ellen Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you like to see me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm editor of the most influential newspaper in Riverdale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's the only newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of people would like my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to run for the school board.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Against Carter Boswell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that is news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you announce that I'm running?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why will the voters vote for you against Boswell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Stewart?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Vote for Ellen Stewart. She cares."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bad slogan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But what do you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I care about the children of our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want them to grow up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,without cultural programs in our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want our children to learn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,more than reading, writing, and arithmetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to keep the after-school programs -
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the music, the concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a bad plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's going to pay for all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens of Riverdale, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to get help
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,from the businessmen and the corporations of Riverdale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what do you want from me, Mrs. Stewart?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't expect you to take my side against Boswell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do need some publicity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so that the people of our town
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,know that I'm running for office
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and that I care about our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly can print the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are now making news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:07:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why will the voters vote for you against Boswell, Mrs. Stewart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"Vote for Ellen Stewart. She cares."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bad slogan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ellen Stewart. She cares."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a good campaign slogan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,People will hear it and know what I stand for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about our children's education,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,not just the school buildings themselves, but the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about what children study and what they learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want them to learn about a variety of subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,including music and literature and art.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I care about our children's activities after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to keep their music programs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,like the orchestra and the chorus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want children to experience the joys of music.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the piano myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've taught music to many children in Riverdale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to keep the other after-school programs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get local businesses, banks
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and other companies in the community to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have children in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and I believe that parents care about education.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want to be on the Riverdale School Board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's a big responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know I can make a difference,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,because I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are the fliers, hot off the press!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over here, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You fold the fliers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Richard and I will put them into the envelopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We finished addressing over three hundred envelopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Need another box?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Mike Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I speak with Mr. or Mrs. Anderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nelson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. This is Robbie Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,my mother is running for the school board?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Miss Kim, Ellen Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"She cares."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, see you at the polls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give her your best wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.72,0:10:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nelson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Mike Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I speak with Mr. or Mrs. Burns?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have done so much
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,in such a short amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till Philip comes home and sees our progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone saw the story in the Riverdale newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Maxwell was very kind
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to print my announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It helps enormously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody in Riverdale reads his paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your photo in it helped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, Richard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a good picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hi, all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,May I... may I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Licking envelopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I fold the fliers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We stuff them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I lick the envelopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Greenberg is on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She says Carter Boswell is on the TV right now -
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,doing a commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What channel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:10:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you ask what I care about, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about the school buildings in need of paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about more lockers for the teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about new fixtures in the hallways,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,not music or dancing or entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about the practical things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, vote for me, Carter Boswell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of people will agree with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad kids can't vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our school, but we can't vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are people in favor of the cultural programs, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There are, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be upset by Boswell's commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go on television, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Boswell's a powerful speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.04,0:12:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ideas are good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'm up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Vote! Vote! Vote! Vote! Vote! Vote!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody, here's what we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out and vote on election day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make a difference, it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your vote if you want better schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So clap your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stomp your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart's running for the school board,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and we know she can't be beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I said clap your hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and stomp your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart's running for the school board,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and we know she can't be beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So vote! Vote! Vote!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want better schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you want your vote to count,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart is the one to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do we want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do we want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come on, let's fight for Ellen Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the one who's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So everybody just be aware
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that Ellen Stewart is the one who cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll make a difference for everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,'cause Ellen Stewart is number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows the importance of music and art.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cultural programs play a big part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep these programs in our schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart's for me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's all give her a cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's all right 'cause Ellen's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do we want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do we want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We vote for Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're yelling for Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're yelling for Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My slogan is "I care".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about people, not things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vote for me, Ellen Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. My name is Ellen Stewart,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm running for the open seat on the school board.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My slogan is "I care".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the word care mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about people, not things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vote for me, Ellen Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we possibly get it on so Riverdale
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,will see it and hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean that when I say "I care",
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about people, not things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vote for me, Ellen Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom is now on television
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,in every appliance store in Riverdale,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,except Hamlin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a Boswell voter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a brilliant idea, Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You inherited your father's brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We got our brains from you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I called channel five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Their TV news is going to cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"Housewife campaigns in appliance stores."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll bet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,some magazine will pick up the story, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:16:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, you're going to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cool down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we're getting some attention now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end the voters will have to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In the hotly contested race
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,for the one seat on the Riverdale School Board,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Ellen Stewart has taken an early lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TV Reporter] Now returning to other local news...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, you're winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TV Reporter] Riverdale High School
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TV Reporter] beat its rival Horace Mann in baseball today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too soon to know for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better than being behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TV Reporter] More sports after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just all calm down,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and wait for the final results.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.18,0:17:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen, why don't you go out to the backyard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and get some fresh air?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You came very close, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost by only a hundred and twenty-one votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost by a very small number of votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one hundred and twenty-one votes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There just wasn't enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you've made a very strong impression
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,on our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have another chance next election.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:18:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, yes, Mr. Maxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Maxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just called to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that you are very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost the election,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but you won the attention of the residents of Riverdale,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,of Boswell, and of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you, Mr. Maxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your kind words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Boswell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,wants to appoint you to a special arts committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending over a reporter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,in the morning to interview you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do an article
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,on "Ellen Stewart, she cares".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll all care now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, Philip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I did make a difference in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And in this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,An important local election took place today in Riverdale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of this community elected a new member of the school board,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Carter Boswell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Opposing him in the campaign was Ellen Stewart, a housewife from Riverdale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, we'll take a look at both campaigns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we turn to the Boswell campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Boswell reached many voters by appearing on local TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about the school buildings in need of paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about more lockers for the teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about new fixtures in the hallways.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Less than a month ago, a new face entered the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Stewart disagreed with Carter Boswell's plans for the Riverdale schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She campaigned very strongly to keep the cultural programs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,in music, art and drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Local appliance stores played a videotape
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,of Mrs. Stewart introducing herself to the voters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Ellen Stewart,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm running for the open seat on the school board.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My slogan is "I care".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I care about people, not things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Stewart's unusual campaign helped her win the attention of the local newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Charles Maxwell, the editor of the Riverdale News,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,praised Mrs. Stewart for caring about the cultural programs in the schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When the first votes were counted early in the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.94,0:21:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it seemed as if Ellen Stewart might win a surprise victory over Carter Boswell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But once all the votes were counted,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Stewart lost by only a hundred and twenty-one votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was a very close election,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.02,0:22:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and Ellen Stewart convinced the people of Riverdale that she cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.48,0:22:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She also convinced Carter Boswell,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,who now wants to appoint Mrs. Stewart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to a special committee for cultural programs in the schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's our special Election Day report
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,on a very important local election.
